PLAT-7. These are PLUGINS, and Extensibility-Model.md §2.1 says in as many
words: "`codetracer_embed.nim` is the sanctioned surface ... **Extensions are
declared consumers.** An extension reaching `ReplayDataStore` directly would
couple to internals that the facade exists to keep private."

Declaring the tree here rather than marking each file is the documented use of
this marker, and it is what makes the rule apply to a plugin somebody adds
later without remembering to opt in.

The point is not tidiness. These fixtures exist to be driven by
`test_plugin_lifecycle.nim` and `test_plugin_effect_budget.nim`, and a fixture
that reached past the facade would be proving the plugin model works over a
door real plugins will not have.
